[verse 1]
Worthy, worthy is the Lamb,
Worthy, worthy is the Lamb;
Worthy, worthy is the Lamb
That was slain.

[chorus]
Glory, hallelujah!
Praise Him, hallelujah!
Glory, hallelujah
To the Lamb!

[verse 2]
Saviour, let Thy kingdom come!
Now the power of sin consume;
Bring Thy blest millennium,
Holy Lamb.

[chorus]
Glory, hallelujah!
Praise Him, hallelujah!
Glory, hallelujah
To the Lamb!

[verse 3]
Thus may we each moment feel,
Love Him, serve Him, praise Him still,
Till we all on Zion’s hill
See the Lamb.

[chorus]
Glory, hallelujah!
Praise Him, hallelujah!
Glory, hallelujah
To the Lamb!
